      "**Repaso final de B1**",
      "",
      "- *Cláusulas de tiempo:* When I finish, I'll … · as soon as I get … · until you come",
      "- *Condicionales:* If you heat ice, it melts. · If it rains, I'll … · If I won, I would …",
      "- *Wish:* I wish I had … · I wish I could … · I wish I had called",
      "- *Pasiva:* It is made in … · It was invented by … · It can be done.",
      "- *Estilo indirecto:* She said she was … · He asked if … · He told me to …",
      "- *Deducciones:* must be · can't be · might be",
      "- *Contraste:* although · despite · however · whereas",
      "- *So do I · Neither do I*",
      "- *Should have · shouldn't have*",
      "- *Tiempos narrativos:* pasado simple, continuo, perfecto"
    ],
    "common_mistakes_es": [],
    "false_friends": []
